; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18 across us-east, us-west, eu-west). Release history shows v2.3.0 was the most recent production release marked healthy, and v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy in production. Action taken: rolled back checkout-api to v2.3.0 in all production regions. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error (partial failure, mixed versions during that window); a retry completed successfully. Current state: all regions on v2.3.0, healthy=true, error rate 0.002. Follow-up: investigate the v2.3.1 failure root cause before re-releasing; v2.3.1-rc was also marked unhealthy in staging.", "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025"}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 52674, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015jDDveYLUh8aXivz7SH16v", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": "checkout-api-v2.3.1-rollback-sev2-2025", "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 52674, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015jDDveYLUh8aXivz7SH16v", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 54893, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "I rolled checkout-api back to v2.3.0 in all three production regions, and opened SEV2 incident INC-0001, which paged on-call.\n\n- **Rollback:** v2.3.0 was the most recent production release marked healthy. v2.3.1 was the unhealthy release running everywhere. The first rollback attempt halted after us-east with an orchestrator error, leaving the regions mixed. Retrying the same rollback completed it.\n- **Current state:** us-east, us-west and eu-west are all on v2.3.0. The service reports healthy, with error rate down from 0.18 to 0.002.\n- **Incident:** INC-0001 is open at SEV2 for checkout-api. Its summary covers the failure, the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and a follow-up to find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before re-releasing. The first incident request timed out, so I retried with the same idempotency key. The retry returned the single incident, so it should not have created a duplicate page.\n\nThe partial failure is worth raising with the platform team, since the orchestrator stopped mid-rollout once.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01K2zrCFNSKHoVBwFCJsnUHY", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01R9FN7xvubGkGkBx5XFdgrH", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The most recent production release that was healthy is v2.3.0. v2.3.1 is the unhealthy one currently running in all three regions. I'll roll back to v2.3.0.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01FQFscsmcuV1a54bmronf9x", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api", "version": "v2.3.0"}, "name": "rollback", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"citations": null, "text": "The rollback reported a partial failure after us-east. I'll check the current state before doing anything else.", "type": "text"}, {"id": "toolu_01Y9qdaUEVjMTUysEdgxRUKx", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thin