i. Its summary covers the failure, the rollback, the partial failure and retry, and a follow-up to find the root cause of the v2.3.1 failure before re-releasing. The first incident request timed out, so I retried with the same idempotency key. The retry returned the single incident, so it should not have created a duplicate page.\n\nThe partial failure is worth raising with the platform team, since the orchestrator stopped mid-rollout once.", "type": "text"}]}]}